IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-XGRAMMAR-TRIE.

DATA DIVISION.
01 CONTEXT-LEN         PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 VOCAB-SIZE          PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 TRIE-NODES          PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 LATENCY-NS          PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-XGRAMMAR-TRIE.
    IF CONTEXT-LEN == 0 OR VOCAB-SIZE == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE CONTEXT-LEN TO TRIE-NODES.
    MULTIPLY 4 BY TRIE-NODES.
    MOVE 35 TO LATENCY-NS.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 TRIE-NODES.
    WEIGHT 30 LATENCY-NS.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
